{"id": "34181", "title": "公公娶妻", "author": "艾芸", "category": "文学名著", "count": 10, "available": 10, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34181.htm", "intro": "再惨也不过如此──兄嫂把她卖了。五百两。大美人一个，前途却从此无亮。好险！她的买主丈夫竟是个告老还乡的太监！所以，哈！至少躲过了圆房这“一劫”。但──借种？这主意一点都不好玩，偏偏她又作不了主，只好“将就”答应……很、不、妙！借──借出大祸来啦！那做人，他们招惹不起……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34181", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "2172386.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2172387.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2172388.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2172389.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2172390.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2172391.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2172392.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2172393.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2172394.html", "available": true}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2172395.html", "available": true}]}